WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.370 --> 00:00:02.060
- Thanks to CuriosityStream for keeping

00:00:02.060 --> 00:00:03.670
Legal Eagle in the air.

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:06.280
Almost two million
Facebook users have pledged

00:00:06.280 --> 00:00:10.610
to storm Area 51 to
demand answers about UFOs.

00:00:10.610 --> 00:00:14.800
The planned event is scheduled
for September 20th, 2019.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:16.350
We're through the looking glass, people,

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:17.560
the truth is out there.

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:20.920
The US Air Force has used
Area 51 for nuclear testing,

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.240
experimental aircraft and defense systems,

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:26.000
but for decades, people
have suspected that Area 51

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.510
houses dead aliens,
spaceships, and other gear

00:00:28.510 --> 00:00:29.910
related to alien life.

00:00:29.910 --> 00:00:32.010
Although the Facebook user
who organized the event

00:00:32.010 --> 00:00:33.920
has said the whole thing is a joke,

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:36.680
plenty of people are
taking this post seriously.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.360
If just one percent of
people who signed up online

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:41.180
decided to actually show up,

00:00:41.180 --> 00:00:43.390
the government could have
a big problem on its hands,

00:00:43.390 --> 00:00:45.780
and the truth could finally be revealed.

00:00:45.780 --> 00:00:48.210
That's why the Air Force
actually issued a statement.

00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:51.110
Area 51 is an open training
range for the US Air Force,

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:53.210
and we would discourage
anyone from trying to

00:00:53.210 --> 00:00:57.240
come into the area where we
train American armed forces.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:01:00.690
The Air Force is ready to
protect America and its assets.

00:01:00.690 --> 00:01:03.420
What started as a joke is
evolving into a serious attempt

00:01:03.420 --> 00:01:04.970
to learn more about
one of the government's

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:06.990
most notorious military black sites.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:08.450
So what would happen if people actually

00:01:08.450 --> 00:01:10.990
tried to invade Area 51?

00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:13.249
Well we're about to find out.

00:01:13.249 --> 00:01:15.999
(dramatic music)

00:01:17.190 --> 00:01:19.990
Hey Legal Eagles, it's time
to think like a lawyer,

00:01:19.990 --> 00:01:23.270
and today we are talking
about the legal ramifications

00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:27.420
of what would happen if a bunch
of idiots stormed Area 51.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:29.110
So what is Area 51?

00:01:29.110 --> 00:01:32.150
Area 51 is the common name
of a highly classified

00:01:32.150 --> 00:01:34.680
US Air Force facility located within

00:01:34.680 --> 00:01:37.200
the Nevada Test and Training Range.

00:01:37.200 --> 00:01:40.120
The US government set up
Area 51 after World War II,

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.010
when it was developing the U2 spy plane.

00:01:43.010 --> 00:01:46.560
Area 51 is near a dry lake
bed called Groom Lake,

00:01:46.560 --> 00:01:49.050
about 90 miles north of Las Vegas.

00:01:49.050 --> 00:01:52.090
The first U2 planes took flight in 1955,

00:01:52.090 --> 00:01:53.930
and immediately reports poured in

00:01:53.930 --> 00:01:56.956
about unidentified flying objects or UFOs.

00:01:56.956 --> 00:01:59.300
The U2 spy plane was so advanced

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.200
it appeared alien even
to commercial pilots.

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:04.320
Since the US Air Force was
not going to acknowledge

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.150
the existence of its
super-secret spy plane program,

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:08.840
the government dismissed UFO sightings

00:02:08.840 --> 00:02:11.550
as natural phenomena or weather events,

00:02:11.550 --> 00:02:15.690
which has spawned decades of
conspiracy theories ever since.

00:02:15.690 --> 00:02:18.470
Even after the U2 program
stopped testing at the site,

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:21.490
the Air Force continued to use Area 51,

00:02:21.490 --> 00:02:24.430
we just don't know everything
that they have used it for.

00:02:24.430 --> 00:02:27.640
The theories about aliens
intensified in 1989

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:30.760
when an engineer named Bob
Lazar told the local Las Vegas

00:02:30.760 --> 00:02:33.733
news that he had worked on
alien technology at Area 51.

00:02:34.590 --> 00:02:36.390
- Yeah, I didn't even
believe in flying saucers

00:02:36.390 --> 00:02:38.070
up until I was employed at S4.

00:02:38.070 --> 00:02:40.450
- He claimed to have
seen nine different kinds

00:02:40.450 --> 00:02:43.350
of UFOs during his work at Area 51.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.490
The Air Force of course did
not comment on Bob Lazar.

00:02:46.490 --> 00:02:49.010
In fact, for years the
government has refused

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:51.660
to even confirm Area 51's existence,

00:02:51.660 --> 00:02:53.430
despite the many credible accounts

00:02:53.430 --> 00:02:56.190
that real people were
actually working at the site.

00:02:56.190 --> 00:03:00.410
- The government (chuckles)
is doing everything

00:03:00.410 --> 00:03:02.547
but looking out for us.

00:03:02.547 --> 00:03:04.670
The only thing they're
looking out is for themselves.

00:03:04.670 --> 00:03:07.420
- For example, in the 1990s,
lawyer Jonathan Turley

00:03:07.420 --> 00:03:09.820
represented federal workers from Area 51

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:12.810
who had been exposed to some
kind of burning chemical

00:03:12.810 --> 00:03:15.160
that had caused catastrophic
health problems.

00:03:15.160 --> 00:03:17.480
Doctors could not even
identify what chemicals

00:03:17.480 --> 00:03:19.160
could have caused the damage.

00:03:19.160 --> 00:03:21.910
Although the government did
finally acknowledge the site,

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.900
President Clinton issued a blanket waiver

00:03:23.900 --> 00:03:26.530
letting Area 51 keep its chemicals secret.

00:03:26.530 --> 00:03:29.720
Interest in Area 51 piqued again in 2019

00:03:29.720 --> 00:03:32.376
after Lazar went on Joe Rogan's podcast

00:03:32.376 --> 00:03:34.710
to describe his alleged
role in attempting to

00:03:34.710 --> 00:03:37.520
reverse engineer alien
technology at Area 51.

00:03:37.520 --> 00:03:40.340
Lazar is a self-proclaimed
physicist who claims to have

00:03:40.340 --> 00:03:44.320
worked at a facility called
S4 inside of a mountain.

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.100
- I went into the hangar
door and in the hangar door

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.570
was the disc, the flying
saucer that I worked on.

00:03:50.570 --> 00:03:53.170
This was a small reactor
about the size of,

00:03:53.170 --> 00:03:55.780
hemisphere about the size of a basketball

00:03:55.780 --> 00:03:59.380
on a metal plate and when it was running,

00:03:59.380 --> 00:04:01.140
it produced a gravitational field,

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:02.570
a gravitational field of its own.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:04.750
- Regardless of whether Lazar is credible,

00:04:04.750 --> 00:04:08.820
it is undeniable that things
are still happening at Area 51.

00:04:08.820 --> 00:04:11.580
A secret commuter jet
known as Janet Airlines

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:15.240
still transports federal workers
from the Las Vegas Airport

00:04:15.240 --> 00:04:17.010
to the site, it's actually the only way

00:04:17.010 --> 00:04:18.380
the federal workers can get in,

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.030
and the site is actually expanding.

00:04:20.030 --> 00:04:23.080
According to a Popular
Mechanics aerial time lapse,

00:04:23.080 --> 00:04:25.860
a new runway was built,
buildings have been added,

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:28.630
and the government is still
excavating the mountainside.

00:04:28.630 --> 00:04:32.280
So the question is could
people storm Area 51?

00:04:32.280 --> 00:04:35.780
Well, there are two big
problems with storming Area 51.

00:04:35.780 --> 00:04:38.570
The first is practical
and the second is legal.

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:40.880
The practical problem
with storming Area 51

00:04:40.880 --> 00:04:42.570
is how to get close enough to the site

00:04:42.570 --> 00:04:44.680
to actually do or see something.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.510
I'm not gonna go into too much detail

00:04:46.510 --> 00:04:49.940
about all of the practical
problems of storming Area 51

00:04:49.940 --> 00:04:52.310
because Real Life Lore has
already done an amazing

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:54.740
video essay about all
of the practical issues,

00:04:54.740 --> 00:04:57.450
including a lot of information
about Janet Airlines,

00:04:57.450 --> 00:04:59.300
and the issues of storming an air base

00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:01.070
in the middle of the Nevada desert.

00:05:01.070 --> 00:05:02.630
So definitely go check out that video

00:05:02.630 --> 00:05:05.030
after you watch this one,
link in the dublidoo.

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:07.310
But suffice to say, the
closest town to Area 51

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:10.220
is Rachel, Nevada, population of 58.

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.240
Conspiracy theorists
routinely gather there

00:05:12.240 --> 00:05:14.720
for conventions and fun,
and the locals play along

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:18.470
with souvenir shops, alien-themed
food, and general kitsch.

00:05:18.470 --> 00:05:22.120
The only hotel in town
is the Little A'le Inn,

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:25.020
which is already booked for
September 19th and 20th,

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:27.120
so obviously someone intends to show up,

00:05:27.120 --> 00:05:29.370
and they have already booked their rooms.

00:05:29.370 --> 00:05:31.930
Rachel is located on Nevada Highway 375,

00:05:31.930 --> 00:05:34.620
which is sometimes called
the Extraterrestrial Highway.

00:05:34.620 --> 00:05:37.680
To get close to Area 51,
people must take a dirt road

00:05:37.680 --> 00:05:41.800
from Route 375 which
leads to restricted lands.

00:05:41.800 --> 00:05:44.430
You can get about 15
miles up the dirt road

00:05:44.430 --> 00:05:46.710
before you start seeing
fences and security.

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:49.720
Now Area 51 is a classified
military operating area.

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.560
That means that not all of the borders

00:05:51.560 --> 00:05:54.340
of the huge area are fenced or walled.

00:05:54.340 --> 00:05:56.700
However, they are marked by orange posts

00:05:56.700 --> 00:05:58.670
and plenty of warning signs.

00:05:58.670 --> 00:06:01.160
The signs prohibit
photographs and trespass.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:02.580
Those who have approached the borders

00:06:02.580 --> 00:06:04.870
have been confronted by
men wearing camouflage.

00:06:04.870 --> 00:06:07.120
It isn't clear whether
these camouflaged men

00:06:07.120 --> 00:06:09.840
are military personnel
or private security,

00:06:09.840 --> 00:06:13.210
but Area 51 enthusiasts have
dubbed the men Camo Dudes.

00:06:13.210 --> 00:06:15.910
YouTuber Adventures With
Christian has made several trips

00:06:15.910 --> 00:06:18.650
to Area 51, including hiking
nearby mountain ranges

00:06:18.650 --> 00:06:20.870
and driving to various perimeter points.

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.740
Christian once drove up to the back gate,

00:06:22.740 --> 00:06:25.500
which is guarded by a high
fence, several buildings,

00:06:25.500 --> 00:06:27.490
and the camo dudes.

00:06:27.490 --> 00:06:30.290
The armed guards followed
Christian as he drove back.

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:32.020
On another occasion,
Christian tried to sleep

00:06:32.020 --> 00:06:33.930
inside his vehicle near a different gate,

00:06:33.930 --> 00:06:36.183
but he was met by police and again

00:06:36.183 --> 00:06:38.137
camouflaged military personnel.

00:06:38.137 --> 00:06:40.557
The police politely
told Christian to leave.

00:06:40.557 --> 00:06:43.570
Christian's experience seems
to confirm some of the rules

00:06:43.570 --> 00:06:45.640
of engagement for Area
51 security personnel.

00:06:45.640 --> 00:06:48.330
They are reportedly ordered
to observe and act as

00:06:48.330 --> 00:06:49.600
a deterrent, rather than seeking

00:06:49.600 --> 00:06:51.640
direct engagement with trespassers.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:54.140
However, they will contact
local law enforcement

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.430
to deal with anyone who is suspicious.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:06:58.660
The military uses motion sensors, cameras,

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.490
and other early warning
devices to notify them

00:07:00.490 --> 00:07:02.680
every time someone approaches Area 51.

00:07:02.680 --> 00:07:05.240
That's why the best way
to see the restricted area

00:07:05.240 --> 00:07:06.800
might be from the air.

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:10.480
However, it's illegal to fly
over Area 51's air space.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:13.420
The air space above Area 51 is a 23 mile

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:16.372
by 25 mile no fly zone, so don't expect

00:07:16.372 --> 00:07:18.870
that you'll be able to
fly any drones nearby.

00:07:18.870 --> 00:07:20.970
Even pilots from local Air Force bases

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.760
in California and Nevada are prohibited

00:07:22.760 --> 00:07:25.411
from flying over Area
51 without permission.

00:07:25.411 --> 00:07:28.040
Pilots who have attempted
to fly into one of

00:07:28.040 --> 00:07:30.790
the buffer zones around
the air space are punished,

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.390
even if it's just a mistake,

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:35.220
and pilots caught knowingly
flying into Area 51

00:07:35.220 --> 00:07:37.030
air space can be court marshaled.

00:07:37.030 --> 00:07:38.520
Drones are also a no go.

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.980
When Hans Falkner used a
drone to take several videos

00:07:41.980 --> 00:07:45.160
of Area 51 from above, the
military quickly posted

00:07:45.160 --> 00:07:48.320
new signs explicitly
prohibiting the use of drones.

00:07:48.320 --> 00:07:50.970
But let's say you manage
to turn down Route 375

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:52.260
and approach the boundaries,

00:07:52.260 --> 00:07:54.580
will law enforcement be there to stop you?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:58.010
This brings us to the second
issue with storming Area 51,

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.810
the legal problem, and oh boy,

00:07:59.810 --> 00:08:02.200
there are lots of legal problems.

00:08:02.200 --> 00:08:04.780
Trespassing on military bases is a crime

00:08:04.780 --> 00:08:09.320
under Title 18 Section
1382, no person may enter

00:08:09.320 --> 00:08:11.550
a military installation
without permission.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:14.290
Military installations include a, quote,

00:08:14.290 --> 00:08:16.920
military, naval, or
coast guard reservation,

00:08:16.920 --> 00:08:20.880
post, fort, arsenal, yard,
station, or installation.

00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:24.210
Area 51 is considered part
of Edwards Air Force Base,

00:08:24.210 --> 00:08:26.780
so it qualifies as a
place you cannot enter

00:08:26.780 --> 00:08:28.440
without serious consequences.

00:08:28.440 --> 00:08:31.060
Those found guilty of
trespass face six months

00:08:31.060 --> 00:08:34.220
in federal prison, a $500 fine, or both,

00:08:34.220 --> 00:08:37.880
and the authorities take
this issue very seriously.

00:08:37.880 --> 00:08:38.900
No kidding.

00:08:38.900 --> 00:08:41.960
In 2014, a tour bus
accidentally drove past

00:08:41.960 --> 00:08:44.840
the warning signs and got
just inside of Area 51.

00:08:44.840 --> 00:08:47.040
Military personnel armed
with assault rifles

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:48.990
pulled the bus over and
threatened to arrest

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:50.650
the passengers and their guide.

00:08:50.650 --> 00:08:52.810
They were charged with
misdemeanor trespass

00:08:52.810 --> 00:08:55.190
and given $650 fines.

00:08:55.190 --> 00:08:58.250
In 2016, a BBC show called
Conspiracy Road Trip

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:00.340
decided to film the perimeter of Area 51.

00:09:00.340 --> 00:09:01.500
They approached the security hut,

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:03.620
but when no one came out, the crew of 12

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:05.760
decided to keep going
past the security hut

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.422
and see how far they could get.

00:09:07.422 --> 00:09:09.330
(dramatic music)

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.220
- [Narrator] To me, it seemed like

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.793
an ordinary military facility.

00:09:15.280 --> 00:09:17.090
But my companions were convinced

00:09:17.090 --> 00:09:20.120
this was the gateway to the
extraterrestrial secrets.

00:09:20.120 --> 00:09:22.640
- The guards were inside
watching a basketball game.

00:09:22.640 --> 00:09:24.410
When one of the camera
crew knocked on the window

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.730
of the security hut,
armed guards rushed out

00:09:26.730 --> 00:09:28.770
and held the man at gunpoint.

00:09:28.770 --> 00:09:30.220
They were forced to lie on the ground

00:09:30.220 --> 00:09:33.400
for three hours while the
FBI ran security checks.

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:35.750
To would-be alien hunters
and those who believe

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.810
Fox Mulder's claim that
the truth is out there.

00:09:37.810 --> 00:09:41.500
- No government agency has
jurisdiction over the truth.

00:09:41.500 --> 00:09:43.960
- These penalties may seem not so bad.

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.290
It actually gets much, much worse.

00:09:46.290 --> 00:09:49.070
The perimeter of Area 51
contains No Trespass signs

00:09:49.070 --> 00:09:51.700
warning people that the
military can use deadly force.

00:09:51.700 --> 00:09:53.210
Has the military ever used

00:09:53.210 --> 00:09:55.210
deadly force against a trespasser?

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:56.920
Yes, yes they have.

00:09:56.920 --> 00:09:59.040
Earlier this year, Area
51 security personnel

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:01.950
shot and killed a man who
approached the perimeter in a car

00:10:01.950 --> 00:10:04.130
and blew past security checkpoints.

00:10:04.130 --> 00:10:06.900
After an eight-mile car chase,
he jumped out of the car,

00:10:06.900 --> 00:10:09.620
and when the man held a,
quote, cylindrical object

00:10:09.620 --> 00:10:13.120
in his hands, guards shot
him dead on the spot.

00:10:13.120 --> 00:10:16.230
In addition to death, which
is probably bad enough,

00:10:16.230 --> 00:10:18.880
people rounded up after
an attack on Area 51

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:20.800
could be charged with acts of terrorism.

00:10:20.800 --> 00:10:23.020
The Patriot Act defines domestic terrorism

00:10:23.020 --> 00:10:25.720
as an attempt to, quote,
intimidate or coerce

00:10:25.720 --> 00:10:28.250
a civilian population,
to influence the policy

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:30.540
of a government by
intimidation or coercion,

00:10:30.540 --> 00:10:32.880
or to affect the conduct of a government

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.480
by mass destruction,
assassination, or kidnapping.

00:10:35.480 --> 00:10:37.360
Although there is no
separate federal offense

00:10:37.360 --> 00:10:39.500
for domestic terrorism,
defendants could be charged

00:10:39.500 --> 00:10:41.870
under specific state and federal laws.

00:10:41.870 --> 00:10:44.550
For example, it is illegal
to kill or attempt to kill

00:10:44.550 --> 00:10:46.460
a federal agent or to use explosives

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.320
to destroy a federal building.

00:10:48.320 --> 00:10:50.970
These kinds of charges
carry serious prison time.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.930
Even if thousands of alien
enthusiasts showed up

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.830
on September 20th, it
looks like the US military

00:10:56.830 --> 00:10:58.610
would probably be ready to respond.

00:10:58.610 --> 00:11:01.470
Remember that Area 51 is
inside the Nevada Test

00:11:01.470 --> 00:11:03.140
and Training Range, where
the military conducts

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:06.100
live target practice and
conducts simulated war.

00:11:06.100 --> 00:11:07.480
I was curious about this myself,

00:11:07.480 --> 00:11:09.828
so I spoke to a friend who
was a major in the Marines

00:11:09.828 --> 00:11:11.770
serving as an artillery officer,

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.660
joint terminal attack controller,

00:11:13.660 --> 00:11:16.660
and a military prosecutor for
the judge advocate general.

00:11:16.660 --> 00:11:19.190
I asked him what would happen
if thousands of civilians

00:11:19.190 --> 00:11:21.750
stormed Area 51 and where
they would be tried.

00:11:21.750 --> 00:11:24.370
His response was they
wouldn't be tried anywhere

00:11:24.370 --> 00:11:25.660
because they'd be dead.

00:11:25.660 --> 00:11:27.650
So there's that, good night everyone!

00:11:27.650 --> 00:11:28.930
But when I pressed him, he said that

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.780
supposing they actually survived,

00:11:30.780 --> 00:11:33.110
they'd be tried in the local
federal district court,

00:11:33.110 --> 00:11:36.450
which would be the federal
court in the district of Nevada.

00:11:36.450 --> 00:11:38.620
But he also pointed out
that the military is not

00:11:38.620 --> 00:11:40.240
in the habit of fighting
back in the media,

00:11:40.240 --> 00:11:42.690
so they would be
especially reluctant to use

00:11:42.690 --> 00:11:45.190
lethal force against
a huge group of people

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:47.000
in a highly publicized event.

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:50.090
Now given the forewarning
to the US military,

00:11:50.090 --> 00:11:51.790
the Air Force is likely building up

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:54.093
a supply of non-lethal force.

00:11:54.093 --> 00:11:56.520
An actual invasion would be met with

00:11:56.520 --> 00:11:58.757
multiple levels of non-lethal force

00:11:58.757 --> 00:12:01.350
in ascending levels of brutality.

00:12:01.350 --> 00:12:04.510
So long as the buildings
and hangars were secure,

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:06.490
the Air Force would be unlikely to use

00:12:06.490 --> 00:12:09.900
more than really, really
painful, less than lethal force.

00:12:09.900 --> 00:12:11.030
So what's the verdict?

00:12:11.030 --> 00:12:14.710
Could people storm Area 51
and make something happen?

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:17.240
Probably, but what would actually happen

00:12:17.240 --> 00:12:18.990
would be mass arrests,

00:12:18.990 --> 00:12:22.250
and even death if people
got particularly aggressive.

00:12:22.250 --> 00:12:24.610
Of course, this doesn't mean
that there aren't questions

00:12:24.610 --> 00:12:26.830
about Area 51 that are worth asking.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:29.810
It's just unlikely that
massing outside the entrance

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.430
to an Air Force base will
yield any real answers.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:33.670
What has worked?

00:12:33.670 --> 00:12:36.580
Well, a good, old-fashioned
Freedom of Information Act

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:37.760
or a FOIA request.

00:12:37.760 --> 00:12:40.830
Back in 2005, Jeffrey T. Richelson,

00:12:40.830 --> 00:12:42.970
a senior fellow at the
National Security Archives,

00:12:42.970 --> 00:12:45.990
submitted a FOIA request about Area 51.

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:48.970
Eight years later, the CIA
sent back the largest cache

00:12:48.970 --> 00:12:51.509
of documents about Area 51 ever released,

00:12:51.509 --> 00:12:55.156
and confirming the site's
existence for the very first time.

00:12:55.156 --> 00:12:56.870
And confirming once again

00:12:56.870 --> 00:13:01.490
that the lawyers are the
real American heroes.

00:13:01.490 --> 00:13:04.520
Now obviously, aliens have
never come to planet Earth,

00:13:04.520 --> 00:13:06.960
but it's only a matter
of time until they do.

00:13:06.960 --> 00:13:09.440
Now if you want to prepare
for an alien invasion,

