00:13:18.570 --> 00:13:20.710
on the scenarios that
might actually unfold

00:13:20.710 --> 00:13:23.560
if aliens did find us and
decide to visit Earth.

00:13:23.560 --> 00:13:26.180
It's a great bit of
speculative non-fiction,

00:13:26.180 --> 00:13:29.130
and it asks should we even be
searching for extraterrestrial

00:13:29.130 --> 00:13:31.470
life, and what are the
risks of reaching out

